                "retweet_count": 14,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "It was great to be in community with our veterans here in Western PA to recognize their service and sacrifice at the opening of Veterans Place\u2019s new Heroes Terrace Meditation Area. \n\nLet's continue to honor them by fighting for dignified housing, affordable healthcare, and mental health support across our country.",
