                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 1,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "For weeks, House Democrats have pushed Republicans to return to the negotiating table\u202fto address this healthcare crisis of their own making\u202fand reopen the government so federal workers can receive their paychecks, benefits like SNAP can resume, and programs like Head Start and LIHEAP can continue without disruption.",
