                "reply_count": 3808,
                "retweet_count": 134,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "160 years ago, the 13th Amendment was ratified but Black Americans are still living through the effects of enslavement.\n\nOur systems of inequity continue to sanction countless injustices from the racial wealth gap to redlining to healthcare disparities.\n\nWhere the government has created a harm it has a duty to repair. Passing the Reparations Now resolution is a great place to start.",
