                "retweet_count": 28,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I asked folks in PA-12 how much their healthcare premiums would go up if Republicans allow ACA subsidies to expire in just a few weeks.\n\nSome said nearly 300%. Most working people can't afford that. We have to fix our broken healthcare system so people don't go bankrupt for basic care.",
